<%- /*
Scaffolded as rustfmt.toml by rust-systems (internal/flavor/definitions.go). cargo fmt passes each
crate's edition to rustfmt, but rustfmt run directly reads the edition from this file, so the two
disagree wherever this file names another one. The edition is therefore the one the root
Cargo.toml gives [workspace.package], else its [package] (.RustEdition,
internal/flavor/rustfmt.go), and the key is left out when it gives neither, since rustfmt and
Cargo then both default to 2015. The 2021 and 2024 renderings are byte for byte the texts earlier
releases wrote unconditionally, recorded in priorRustfmtDigests so adoption refreshes an unedited
copy (TestRustfmtPriorTextsAreEarlierRenderings, internal/flavor/rustfmt_test.go).
*/ -%>
<% if .RustEdition -%>
edition = "<% .RustEdition %>"
<% end -%>
max_width = 100
newline_style = "Unix"
use_small_heuristics = "Default"
